@startuml services-architecture
' Zoom level 2: how the six services could be joined. The two demo stacks (Track 2A, Caret) are drawn as separate boxes
' because they are separate in the demos; the one dashed line is a design option, not something we run. Eventing,
' conformance and the imaging provider are on the map (services-map.puml) and left off here to keep this readable.
!include palette.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowFontSize 20
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam nodesep 40
left to right direction

rectangle "Track 2A demo stack" as T2A #FFFFFF;line:757579;line.bold {
  rectangle "Referrer app\n(browser / EMR)" as REF #F2F2F2;line:757579
  rectangle "Directory\nHCPD / Qld PD on FHIR" as DIR #$L2
  rectangle "Referral and\nbooking server" as SRV #$L2
}
rectangle "Caret demo stack" as CAR #FFFFFF;line:757579;line.bold {
  rectangle "Legacy RIS\nHL7 v2 over MLLP" as RIS #F2F2F2;line:757579
  rectangle "<color:white>Legacy adapter</color>\n<color:white>v2 to FHIR maps</color>" as ADP #$L3
}
rectangle "Terminology\nOntoserver" as TX #$L1

REF --> DIR : 1 discover
REF --> SRV : 2 refer, 3 book
RIS --> ADP : HL7 v2
DIR --> TX
SRV --> TX
ADP .up.> SRV #757579 : option only,\nnot in the demos

REF -[hidden]down-> RIS
DIR -[hidden]down-> SRV
@enduml
